    <briefdescription>
<para>Controls the markers a series draws at its data points. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Accessible via the <computeroutput>marker</computeroutput> CONSTANT grouped property of <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PointCloud" kindref="compound">PointCloud</ref></computeroutput>, for example <computeroutput>marker.shape: <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PlotSeries_1a8e155e26d6f57c4bd93f41cd5e2fe619a8f7671185d590914ac21c7511767b699" kindref="member">QAccelPlot.LineCurve.Diamond</ref></computeroutput>. Defaults depend on the owning series.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PointCloud" kindref="compound">PointCloud</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
